sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User's browser
  participant A as Your app (integration)
  participant W as webexapis.com/v1
  U->>A: "Connect to Webex"
  A-->>U: redirect to /v1/authorize?client_id&response_type=code<br/>&redirect_uri&scope=spark:messages_write ...&state
  U->>W: sign in + approve scopes
  W-->>U: redirect to redirect_uri?code=...&state=...
  U->>A: GET redirect_uri?code=...
  A->>W: POST /v1/access_token grant_type=authorization_code<br/>client_id, client_secret, code, redirect_uri
  W-->>A: access_token (~14 d), refresh_token (~90 d)
  A->>W: GET /v1/people/me  Authorization: Bearer access_token
  A->>W: later: POST /v1/access_token grant_type=refresh_token
